,"committer":{"name":"Gopher Robot","email":"gobot@golang.org","date":"2023-11-09T20:10:26Z"},"message":"all: replace all usages of golang.org/x/sys/execabs with os/exec\n\nThe \"golang.org/x/sys/execabs\" package was introduced to address a\nsecurity issue on Windows, and changing the default behavior of os/exec\nwas considered a breaking change. go1.19 applied the behavior that was\npreviously implemented in the execabs package through CL 403274.\n\nThis reverts fe37c9e135b934191089b245ac29325091462508 (CL 284773).\nUpdates #43724.\n\nChange-Id: I53987d0d0009b8dd11e05fc3d17cbffb9625a9c1\nGitHub-Last-Rev: 18e93f39c4e539c28166d4e29a58bbe0eb5711e7\nGitHub-Pull-Request: golang/tools#455\nReviewed-on: https://go-review.googlesource.com/c/tools/+/539017\nLUCI-TryBot-Result: Go LUCI <golang-scoped@luci-project-accounts.iam.gserviceaccount.com>\nAuto-Submit: Bryan Mills <bcmills@google.com>\nReviewed-by: Bryan Mills <bcmills@google.com>\nReviewed-by: Roland Shoemaker <roland@golang.org>\nCommit-Queue: Bryan Mills <bcmills@google.com>","tree":{"sha":"92dc2406bb5d80e39d6010dc078290c26020bad4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/golang/tools/git/trees/92dc2406bb5d80e39d6010dc078290c26020bad4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/golang/tools/git/commits/f60f2e6aa42c945111053771ea53938694791d83","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/golang/tools/commits/f60f2e6aa42c945111053771ea53938694791d83","html_url":"https://github.com/golang/tools/commit/f60f2e6aa42c945111053771ea53938694791d83","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/golang/tools/commits/f60f2e6aa42c945111053771ea53938694791d83/comments","author":{"login":"thaJeztah","id":1804568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDQ1Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1804568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thaJeztah","html_url":"https://github.com/thaJeztah","followers_